#@ Template for ~/.dircolors: palette/generate.py fills the double-brace colours. Edit this, not .dircolors.
#@ Was Dracula; its colours map to: purple -> accent (directories), cyan, green, pink -> magenta, red,
#@ yellow -> ANSI, comment -> fg_dim, fg/bg -> fg/bg.
